**Adding a guard:** build it, then propose one row via the inbox (the steward places it). State its
Level and its teeth honestly — exit `0` is `FLAGS`, whatever the banner says. A guard not in this
table is invisible; one whose teeth are mis-stated is worse, because it buys false confidence.
